r_id: int) -> bool:\n   492\t        \"\"\"Phase 1 of split KV decompress: wait_pipeline_kv + scatter H2D.\n   493\t\n   494\t        Returns True if H2D was launched (caller must later call\n   495\t        ``finish_kv_decompress``).  Returns False when the layer uses\n   496\t        the uncompressed path or has no persistent data. The raw path calls\n   497\t        ``load_kv`` internally; an empty persistent selection does not fall\n   498\t        back to raw and only stages any tail rollover work.\n   499\t        \"\"\"\n   500\t        if not DualMemoryLoader.use_kv_comp:\n   501\t            self.load_kv(layer_id, True)\n   502\t            return False\n   503\t        if not self._uses_compressed_kv_load(layer_id):\n   504\t            self.load_kv(layer_id, True)\n   505\t            return False\n   506\t\n   507\t        kv_sys = DualMemoryLoader.kv_offload_system\n   508\t\n   509\t        # Wait for C++ compress workers to finish NEW blocks\n